rhd|n|A doing, making, or preparing. ; An effect produced or achieved; anything done or that comes to pass; an act; an event; a circumstance. ; Reality; actuality; truth; as, he, in fact, excelled all the rest; the fact is, he was beaten. ; The assertion or statement of a thing done or existing; sometimes, even when false, improperly put, by a transfer of meaning, for the thing done, or supposed to be done; a thing supposed or asserted to be done; as, history abounds with false facts.	a:1a3o,62,9;1u81,15,4;1win,12,5~1a3o,62,9;1win,12,5;1u81,15,4	V:1qvc,32,3~1qvc,32,3	n:ueu,31,4~ueu,31,4
